@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra dich vu
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### 4. Tao luot nop cho bai tap da dong (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/closed"
}